<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 16.4022%;" width="114">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">口腔颌面部囊肿</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 184px; width: 41.4487%;" rowspan="2" width="331">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">1.描述识别常见的牙源性囊肿和非牙源性囊肿的病理表现；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">2.对常见囊肿做出病理诊断；解释说明口腔颌面部囊肿的一般特点、常用分类及原因；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">3.学习囊肿分类变化的历史，重视辨明口腔颌面部囊肿的常用分类及原因。</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 17.1104%;" width="76">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">任务引擎</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 115px; width: 4.02737%;" width="28">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">四</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 115px; width: 5.17879%;" width="36">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">6-9</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 115px; width: 16.4022%;" width="114">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">实验：口腔颌面部囊肿</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 115px; width: 17.1104%;" width="76">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">绘图作业</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">小组汇报</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 184px; width: 4.02737%;" rowspan="2" width="28">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">13</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 4.02737%;" width="28">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">二</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 5.17879%;" width="36">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">3-4</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 16.4022%;" width="114">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">牙源性肿瘤</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 184px; width: 41.4487%;" rowspan="2" width="331">
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">1.能辨别常见牙源性肿瘤的病理变化；并绘图成釉细胞瘤的组织病理学变化；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">2.应用基础知识对常见牙源性肿瘤做出诊断；分析说明牙源性肿瘤国际分类及原因；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: KaiTi;">3.学习肿瘤分类变化的历史，领悟人类对疾病的不断探索和加深认识。</span></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 69px; width: 17.1104%;" width="76">
